Package: m6APrediction
Type: Package
Title: Predict RNA m6A Sites from Sequence and Transcript Features
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Yilin", "Xu", email = "yilin.xu24@student.xjtlu.edu.cn", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Uses the fitted random forest supplied with the BIO215 Practical 6
    materials to predict m6A site status from a five nucleotide DNA context and
    transcript features. Provides functions for a feature table or one site.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: randomForest, stats
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
